- raid10_end_read/write_request、one_write_done、raid_end_bio_io、end_sync_request 按飞牛接入 md_start_dfr/md_stop_dfr
- raid10_run: MD_FAST_DISCARD(非 cluster 且 far_copies==1); raid10_set_queue_limits 置 QUEUE_FLAG_UNUSED_HINT
- raid10_map_sector / raid10_align_chunk_addr_virt_to_dev(只支持 near 布局)
- md_sb_pending 取代直接判断 MD_SB_CHANGE_PENDING
- raid1: 合并时 da3da191f 去掉的 uptodate 参数(DFR 路径要用)恢复
- raid5_spare_active: 判断 enable_requested_resync_hints(不是 allow_fast_resync)

Co-Authored-By: Claude Sonnet 5.5 <noreply@anthropic.com>
